      "source_quote": "　　卞彬字士蔚，濟陰冤句人也。祖嗣之，中領軍。父延之，有剛氣，爲上虞令。",
      "reading": "卞彬字士蔚，祖卞嗣之，父卞延之。",
      "note": "卞彬字士蔚，祖卞嗣之，父卞延之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p011",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 36,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete",
